# FerriteCMS plugin registry index public key (minisign), embedded by `ferrite` for the
# default registry (M6-2, design 14 §5.2). This is a placeholder and holds no key: a binary
# built from it has the default registry off; any registry works with an explicit
# `[plugins] registry_key`. The release owner replaces this with the public half of the
# REGISTRY_SECRET_KEY (docs/design/09-operations.md, "Plugin keys").
